*Experiment 1: Installation of Virtual Box and Ubuntu Os*

*Procedure*
1) Download Virtual Box from its official website
2) Run the installer and follow the setup wizard
3) Click install and complete the installation
4) Download the ubuntu ISO file
5) Open Virtual Box and Click new
6) Create a Vm, name it and select Iso file
7) Allocate RAM, CPU and storage
8) Start the virtual Machine and select install
9) Follow the on screen instructions
10) Create a username and password
11) Complete the installation and restart the virtual machine
